From: Paweł Phan <szop.hektar_1w@icloud.com>
Subject: [PATCH] package/dropbear: bump to version 2026.94

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Paweł Phan <szop.hektar_1w@icloud.com>

2026.94, of 23 July 2026, is the newest release of dropbear: it fixes the
build of scp that 2026.93 broke, prints an IPv6 address with a port in
square brackets, and takes longer paths in scp. Its hash is the one of
SHA256SUM.asc, which the key of dropbear's releases (F7347EF2 EE2E07A2
67628CA9 44931494 F29C6773) signs. The release's carried patch of scp
applies unchanged, and the licence files are the same.

Signed-off-by: Paweł Phan <szop.hektar_1w@icloud.com>
---
 package/dropbear/dropbear.hash | 2 +-
 package/dropbear/dropbear.mk   | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/dropbear/dropbear.hash b/package/dropbear/dropbear.hash
index 2538132..3c48dfe 100644
--- a/package/dropbear/dropbear.hash
+++ b/package/dropbear/dropbear.hash
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 # From https://matt.ucc.asn.au/dropbear/releases/SHA256SUM.asc
-sha256  310a6087952897c182efbe16088fa0c4d07c467e850a22699472137278fabf09  dropbear-2026.93.tar.bz2
+sha256  e098034a843699200c8c977a991fff73159735bf795d5f72ef672c41a6b1ae81  dropbear-2026.94.tar.bz2
 
 # License file, locally computed
 sha256  a99ce657d790b761c132ee7e0de18edb437ae6361e536d991c6a12f36e770445  LICENSE
diff --git a/package/dropbear/dropbear.mk b/package/dropbear/dropbear.mk
index e595ebc..63d910b 100644
--- a/package/dropbear/dropbear.mk
+++ b/package/dropbear/dropbear.mk
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 #
 ################################################################################
 
-DROPBEAR_VERSION = 2026.93
+DROPBEAR_VERSION = 2026.94
 DROPBEAR_SITE = https://matt.ucc.asn.au/dropbear/releases
 DROPBEAR_SOURCE = dropbear-$(DROPBEAR_VERSION).tar.bz2
 DROPBEAR_LICENSE = MIT, BSD-2-Clause, Public domain
